      "kind": "phrase",
      "promptEs": "referirse a + persona, cosa o tema",
      "questionEn": "How do you say what someone or something refers to?",
      "answerEn": "Use the matching form of referirse, then a, then name the person, thing, or topic.",
      "noteEn": "Referirse is a pronominal verb, so use me, te, se, nos, os, or se to match the subject. The short word a is required before the target. In questions, the target can move before the verb, as in ¿A qué te refieres?",
